AB  - We read about the results of artificial intelligence research almost every day in magazines, on social media portals and in news reports. The topic of self-driving vehicles is also coming up more and more often in the media, beyond the professional circles, more often in connection with an accident. The successful implementation of self-driving cars is unthinkable without artificial intelligence. In this article, we present techniques to confuse artificial intelligence in self-driving vehicles, to force it to make a decision that could cause an accident. At the end of the paper, we outline how to create murderer artificial intelligence in self-driving vehicles that could pose a threat not only to the occupants of the vehicle, but also to their environment.
ER  - 

