AB  - Artificial intelligence (AI) has emerged as a transformative technology, displaying enormous promise and impact across many areas. Communication, a pillar of modern-day society, has also begun adopting applications of AI. This paper investigates the advancement of AI-powered communication by examining the technology, current uses, and future outlook. It sheds light on AI communication's deep implications for the communication sphere and broader society. On the technology front, specialized AI techniques for communication tasks have been rolled out, including machine translation, neural networks and more. Application-Wise, AI communication already underpins intelligent assistants, information filtering and personalized recommendations. Looking ahead, AI communications could drive more customized, interactive and smart communication experiences, while also raising pressing privacy and ethical considerations needing urgent attention. Overall, AI-charged communication is profoundly penetrating and reshaping communication markets and people's lifestyles.
