AB  - The development of glider UAV parachute-less airdrop has brought about a fundamental change in airdrop resupply, realizing the right time, right place, and right amount of resupply of equipment and munitions, and comprehensively enhancing the deployment and guarantee capability of troops at the strategic and tactical levels. In order to promote the research and application of parachute-free airdrop in China, this paper reviews the development status of foreign glider UAV parachute-free airdrop, compares the advantages and limitations of various glider UAVs, and looks forward to the future development trend of glider UAVs, which will be developed in the direction of improving autonomy, intelligence, low cost, stealth, clustering, environmental adaptability, and autonomous takeoff and landing in order to provide a reference for the development of glider UAV parachute-free airdrop technology in China. in order to provide reference for the development of China’s glider UAV parachute-less airdrop technology.
